        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "The Golden Age was a peaceful period of time indeed, and people during this period of time produced an enormous amount of documents on paper—something that put the Archaeological Team through excruciating suffering when they were out collecting them."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Churning away as it swallows down all the cards, the scanner is redolent of a binge eater whose appetite knows no end."
